# Domain units

Canonical (engine/state only): volume `L`, mass `g`, amount `mol`, molar conc `mol/L`, mass conc `g/L`, equivalent conc `eq/L`, temperature `degC`, density `g/cm3`, pH none.

- Normalize user unit → canonical before engine. Never compute with display units.
- Keep `originalValue`/`originalUnit` in input metadata only.
- Same-dimension convert by exact factor (mL→L = /1000). `mg/L`→`mol/L` needs molar-mass bundle (Cu 63.546 g/mol).
- Reject unknown unit or wrong dimension with typed validation error; do not run engine.
- Domain module: no React, DOM, or Supabase.
- Vitest colocated; golden/full precision; UI rounding is presentation, not this module.
